[ti:Shenandoah]
[ar:Traditional]
[00:00.00]Oh Shenandoah, I long to hear you
[00:13.00]Away, you rolling river
[00:26.00]Oh Shenandoah, I long to hear you
[00:33.00]Away, I'm bound away, across the wide Missouri
[00:39.00]Oh Shenandoah, I love your daughter
[00:45.00]Away, you rolling river
[00:55.00]I'll take her across yon rolling water
[01:00.00]Away, I'm bound away, across the wide Missouri
[01:05.00]The chief disdained the trader's dollars
[01:10.00]Away, you rolling river
[01:15.00]My daughter never you shall follow
[01:21.00]Away, I'm bound away, across the wide Missouri
